5,Mayi-Yapi | Always Will Be,https://www.alwayswillbe.com/mob/mayi-yapi,"Yathi winja, 'good day' in Mayi-Yapi a language of North-West Queensland. The Mayi-Yapi language region includes the landscape within the local government boundaries of the Cloncurry Shire Council.",Mayi-Yapi,Australian
